== diags.diag/return-on-new-line
BYN1042 3:9 `return` takes its value on the same line
  label on the next line
  help move the value to the line of `return`
  fix 2:11-3:9  
BYN1042 10:17 `break` takes its value on the same line
  label on the next line
  help move the value to the line of `break`
  fix 9:18-10:17  
